        "subject": "fix(material/slider): match active & focus state on IOS (#27546)",
        "final_disposition": "irrelevant",
        "reason": "The patch keeps the MDC slider thumb active on iOS only when the pointer is on the thumb, and it skips pointer focus and animation on iOS. The owned slider has no MatSliderThumb and sets _isActive from the focus origin. That iOS path was not added.",
